[{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0010","text":"买到了呢。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0020","text":"呵呵，是啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0030","text":"不过，这点分量对我来说小菜一碟。\n说我是为了这个才锻炼的也不为过！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0040","text":"诶？　是为了这个？\n──啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0050","text":"怎么了？　智代子。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0060","text":"夏叶酱你看那里！\n松饼……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0070","text":"……啊，原来如此。\n好漂亮的松饼呢。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0080","text":"确实看起来很好吃，\n但会不会偏离今天的主题了呀？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0090","text":"啊哈哈，说得也是！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0100","text":"下次和大家一起来的时候再吃──怎么样！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0110","text":"嗯。\n那样比较好──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0120","text":"喂……智代子！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0130","text":"嗯！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0140","text":"……你看！\n这朵花戴着太阳镜在跳舞呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0150","text":"哇──，好怀念……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0160","text":"哦？智代子见过这个吗？\n呵呵，真有意思……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0170","text":"杂货店里真的什么有趣的东西都有呢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0180","text":"喂，智代子……！\n那个是用来做什么的？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0190","text":"等等……\n这个是什么？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_03030000_04_0200","text":"那个是────"}]
